[141.96124, "o", "Target language: ja\r\nTarget text: 前略テレビの前の視聴者様。このアニメに出てくるやつらは不良です。だから決して。このアニメなので。\r\nSource text: the guys that appear in this anime are delinquents, please do not under any circumstances imitate anything. They do. Don't do it man, I'm serious. Bad idea.\r\nGenerating TTS audio with espeak-ng...\r\n"]
[142.095219, "o", "TTS duration: 18.202404s, Target: 12.116s\r\nAdjusting speed by factor: 1.5023443380653683\r\n"]
[142.219327, "o", "Measuring loudness...\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/root/dubbing_v2.py\", line 95, in <module>\r\n"]
